{"id":"dd3691bd016b708d","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-so-horn.md","title":"SO(Horn)","display":"df-so-horn — SO(Horn)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-so-horn","aliases":["29-df-so-horn"],"display":"df-so-horn — SO(Horn)","depends_on":["[[29-df-second-order]]","[[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 9.26; Lemma 9.28, pp.151,153–154, DjVu scans 166,168–169","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本及扫描页166图像；核对范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-so-horn"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-so-horn</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-so-horn — SO(Horn)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4db9fd38055efd65\" href=\"?note=4db9fd38055efd65\" title=\"29-df-second-order\">29-df-second-order</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8372f1f6b9135d87\" href=\"?note=8372f1f6b9135d87\" title=\"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics\">29-df-so-quantifier-semantics</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 9.26; Lemma 9.28, pp.151,153–154, DjVu scans 166,168–169"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本及扫描页166图像；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar R=(R_1,\\ldots,R_m)\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\bar R=(R_1,\\ldots,R_m)\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)|=m\">\\(|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)|=m\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}^m\">\\(\\bar Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}^m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,\\ell\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,\\ell\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\">\\(\\bar x\\)</span> 为无重复个体变量序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_j\">\\(C_j\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LitMat}[\\tau;\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)]\">\\(\\operatorname{LitMat}[\\tau;\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)]\\)</span> 中元素的有限序列，允许重复；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar C=(C_1,\\ldots,C_\\ell)\">\\(\\bar C=(C_1,\\ldots,C_\\ell)\\)</span>。量词前缀及有限合取、析取使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4db9fd38055efd65\" href=\"?note=4db9fd38055efd65\" title=\"29-df-second-order\">29-df-second-order</a> 的递归，不使用未定括号的自然语言约定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rar}\">\\(\\operatorname{rar}\\)</span> 是关系变量的元数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fv}_1,\\operatorname{AtMat},\\operatorname{Pref}\">\\(\\operatorname{fv}_1,\\operatorname{AtMat},\\operatorname{Pref}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]\\)</span> 均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4db9fd38055efd65\" href=\"?note=4db9fd38055efd65\" title=\"29-df-second-order\">29-df-second-order</a>。计数对象是文字的出现位置，不是去重后的集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>计数函数的参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\operatorname{LitMat}[\\tau;\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(C\\in\\operatorname{LitMat}[\\tau;\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；文字集定义中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq\\mathrm{RelVar}\">\\(V\\subseteq\\mathrm{RelVar}\\)</span> 为有限集合。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LitMat}[\\tau;V]\\coloneqq\\operatorname{AtMat}[\\tau;V]\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\mid\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{AtMat}[\\tau;V]\\},\\qquad V\\subseteq\\mathrm{RelVar},\\quad|V|&lt;\\infty.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LitMat}[\\tau;V]\\coloneqq\\operatorname{AtMat}[\\tau;V]\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\mid\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{AtMat}[\\tau;V]\\},\\qquad V\\subseteq\\mathrm{RelVar},\\quad|V|&lt;\\infty.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PosSO}_{\\tau,\\bar R}(C)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|C|\\}\\mid C_h\\in\\{R(\\bar t)\\mid R\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R),\\ \\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau}^{\\operatorname{rar}(R)}\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PosSO}_{\\tau,\\bar R}(C)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|C|\\}\\mid C_h\\in\\{R(\\bar t)\\mid R\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R),\\ \\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau}^{\\operatorname{rar}(R)}\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SOLit}_{\\tau,\\bar R}(C)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|C|\\}\\mid C_h\\in\\{R(\\bar t),\\neg R(\\bar t)\\mid R\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R),\\ \\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau}^{\\operatorname{rar}(R)}\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SOLit}_{\\tau,\\bar R}(C)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|C|\\}\\mid C_h\\in\\{R(\\bar t),\\neg R(\\bar t)\\mid R\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R),\\ \\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau}^{\\operatorname{rar}(R)}\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SO(Horn)}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{Pref}(\\bar Q,\\bar R,(\\forall\\bar x)\\bigwedge\\langle\\bigvee C_1,\\ldots,\\bigvee C_\\ell\\rangle)\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;m,\\ell\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad\\bar R\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}^m,\\quad|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)|=m,\\quad\\bar Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}^m,\\\\&amp;\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega},\\quad|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=|\\bar x|,\\\\&amp;\\bar C\\in\\bigl(\\operatorname{LitMat}[\\tau;\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)]^{&lt;\\omega}\\bigr)^\\ell,\\\\&amp;\\bigcup_{j=1}^{\\ell}\\bigcup_{h=1}^{|C_j|}\\operatorname{fv}_1((C_j)_h)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x),\\\\&amp;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\ell\\}\\;|\\operatorname{PosSO}_{\\tau,\\bar R}(C_j)|\\leq1\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SO(Horn)}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{Pref}(\\bar Q,\\bar R,(\\forall\\bar x)\\bigwedge\\langle\\bigvee C_1,\\ldots,\\bigvee C_\\ell\\rangle)\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&amp;m,\\ell\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad\\bar R\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}^m,\\quad|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)|=m,\\quad\\bar Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}^m,\\\\&amp;\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega},\\quad|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=|\\bar x|,\\\\&amp;\\bar C\\in\\bigl(\\operatorname{LitMat}[\\tau;\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)]^{&lt;\\omega}\\bigr)^\\ell,\\\\&amp;\\bigcup_{j=1}^{\\ell}\\bigcup_{h=1}^{|C_j|}\\operatorname{fv}_1((C_j)_h)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x),\\\\&amp;\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\ell\\}\\;|\\operatorname{PosSO}_{\\tau,\\bar R}(C_j)|\\leq1\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 9.26，印刷页 151，扫描页 166。Horn 只限制每子句中的正二阶文字数；Krom 限制二阶文字总数，不限制输入文字数。原书允许任意二阶量词前缀；Lemma 9.28（印刷页 153–154）才说明其布尔查询表达力等同于存在二阶前缀。本次不再把该表达力结论偷换成语法定义。</p>\n<p>子句改用序列并按出现位置计数，忠实于原书 occurrence 条件。若将文字先存为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(x)\\lor R(x)\">\\(R(x)\\lor R(x)\\)</span> 会被去重为一个正文字而误入原书的语法片段；虽然去重不改真值，却会改变所定义的句子集合。这里两个计数函数返回位置集合。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-second-order","status":"resolved","id":"4db9fd38055efd65","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-second-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-so-quantifier-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"8372f1f6b9135d87","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-so-quantifier-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-second-order","status":"resolved","id":"4db9fd38055efd65","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bar x$ 为无重复个体变量序列。$C_j$ 是 $\\operatorname{LitMat}[\\tau;\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)]$ 中元素的有限序列，允许重复；$\\bar C=(C_1,\\ldots,C_\\ell)$。量词前缀及有限合取、析取使用 [[29-df-second-order]] 的递归，不使用未定括号的自然语言约定。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-second-order","status":"resolved","id":"4db9fd38055efd65","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{rar}$ 是关系变量的元数；$\\operatorname{fv}_1,\\operatorname{AtMat},\\operatorname{Pref}$ 和 $\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]$ 均取 [[29-df-second-order]]。计数对象是文字的出现位置，不是去重后的集合。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar R=(R_1,\\ldots,R_m)\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)|=m","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}^m","display":false},{"tex":"m,\\ell\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x","display":false},{"tex":"C_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LitMat}[\\tau;\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)]","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar C=(C_1,\\ldots,C_\\ell)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{fv}_1,\\operatorname{AtMat},\\operatorname{Pref}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{SO}}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\operatorname{LitMat}[\\tau;\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"V\\subseteq\\mathrm{RelVar}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LitMat}[\\tau;V]\\coloneqq\\operatorname{AtMat}[\\tau;V]\\cup\\{\\neg\\alpha\\mid\\alpha\\in\\operatorname{AtMat}[\\tau;V]\\},\\qquad V\\subseteq\\mathrm{RelVar},\\quad|V|<\\infty.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PosSO}_{\\tau,\\bar R}(C)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|C|\\}\\mid C_h\\in\\{R(\\bar t)\\mid R\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R),\\ \\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau}^{\\operatorname{rar}(R)}\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SOLit}_{\\tau,\\bar R}(C)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\{1,\\ldots,|C|\\}\\mid C_h\\in\\{R(\\bar t),\\neg R(\\bar t)\\mid R\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R),\\ \\bar t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\tau}^{\\operatorname{rar}(R)}\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SO(Horn)}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{Pref}(\\bar Q,\\bar R,(\\forall\\bar x)\\bigwedge\\langle\\bigvee C_1,\\ldots,\\bigvee C_\\ell\\rangle)\\ \\middle|\\ \\begin{aligned}&m,\\ell\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad\\bar R\\in\\mathrm{RelVar}^m,\\quad|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)|=m,\\quad\\bar Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}^m,\\\\&\\bar x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{<\\omega},\\quad|\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x)|=|\\bar x|,\\\\&\\bar C\\in\\bigl(\\operatorname{LitMat}[\\tau;\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar R)]^{<\\omega}\\bigr)^\\ell,\\\\&\\bigcup_{j=1}^{\\ell}\\bigcup_{h=1}^{|C_j|}\\operatorname{fv}_1((C_j)_h)\\subseteq\\operatorname{rng}(\\bar x),\\\\&\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,\\ell\\}\\;|\\operatorname{PosSO}_{\\tau,\\bar R}(C_j)|\\leq1\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"R(